+ Hirīmatā ca dujjīvaṃ, niccaṃ sucigavesinā; Alīnenāppagabbhena,
  suddhājīvena passatā.

+ Yo pāṇamatipāteti, musāvādañca bhāsati; Loke adinnamādiyati,
  paradārañca gacchati.

+ Surāmerayapānañca, yo naro anuyuñjati; Idhevameso lokasmiṃ, mūlaṃ
  khaṇati attano.

+ Evaṃ bho purisa jānāhi, pāpadhammā asaññatā; Mā taṃ lobho adhammo ca,
