buddha magga pakiṇṇake.§soḷasa paṇḍite kodhe, niraye nāge
catuddasa.§arahante dasaggāthā, pāpasukhamhi terasa.§sattarasa
daṇḍadhammaṭṭhe, malamhi ekavīsati.§taṇhāvagge sattabbīsa, tevīsa
